# SIP with AP_ORDER = BP_ORDER = 1 and a single inverse coefficient,
# AP_2_0, above its declared order (synthetic, from the round-3 verifier
# probe p40_ap_bp_beyond). wcslib 8.10 refuses it because BP has no
# coefficient card (inverse degree -1); we refuse it because a non-zero
# AP_2_0 exceeds AP_ORDER = 1 (ParseSIP). Either way no transform.
# EXPECT-WCSLIB-ERROR: Degree must not exceed 9, got -1
NOTE reject: sip_ap_beyond_order
GRID 1 1024 9 1 1024 9
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 1024
NAXIS2  = 1024
CRVAL1  = 150.0
CRVAL2  = 2.0
CRPIX1  = 512.5
CRPIX2  = 512.5
CTYPE1  = 'RA---TAN'
CTYPE2  = 'DEC--TAN'
CD1_1   = -0.0002777
CD1_2   = 0.0
CD2_1   = 0.0
CD2_2   = 0.0002777
A_ORDER = 2
B_ORDER = 2
A_2_0   = 2e-5
A_1_1   = 1e-5
B_0_2   = 2e-5
B_1_1   = -1e-5
AP_ORDER= 1
BP_ORDER= 1
AP_2_0  = -2e-5
